WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.300
"My Secret Vampire"

2
00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:48.790
(Episode 6)

3
00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:26.860
Juwon.

4
00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.140
Are you asleep?

5
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.840
I thought you had
trouble sleeping at night.

6
00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:48.900
Hello?

7
00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.140
Lee Juwon.

8
00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:51.780
Seriously.

9
00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.210
- Why haven't you been answering?
- Uh... hello?

10
00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.290
You've been taking your medicine, right?

11
00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.000
And you're drinking your
blood packs on schedule?

12
00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.130
What are you doing?

13
00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:04.820
Your phone kept ringing
and it was a bit loud.

14
00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.479
I thought you were
asleep, so I picked it up.

15
00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.989
Don't touch my things.

16
00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.650
I thought I made myself perfectly clear.

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:14.536
Do you always just do whatever you want?

18
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.610
I...

19
00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.060
Han Dongha.

20
00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.340
Don't cross the line.

21
00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.870
Weren't you the one
who crossed the line first?

22
00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.580
Why did you come see me today?

23
00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.730
I already told you.

24
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.500
Because I couldn't sleep.

25
00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.670
Is that the only reason?

26
00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.000
No other reason?

27
00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.140
Juwon.

28
00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.490
How many things are you hiding from me?

29
00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.300
Your private life...

30
00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.900
What's so important
that you have to hide it?

31
00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:56.230
Or am I just that untrustworthy?

32
00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.320
That's not what I meant.

33
00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.079
I thought...

34
00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.880
that we had gotten closer.

35
00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.720
Now I'm not too sure.

36
00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.950
You scared me.

37
00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.730
How did you know I was here?

38
00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.450
I know your habits.

39
00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:58.130
What's wrong this time?

40
00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.660
Just spit it out.

41
00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.050
You being this quiet is... weird.

42
00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.290
Right?

43
00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.220
This right here.

44
00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.480
It's really weird.

45
00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:26.270
I'm in a terrible mood.

46
00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.680
I've tried staying up all night reading,

47
00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.820
working out until I'm exhausted,

48
00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.040
but nothing helps.

49
00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.050
Why are you in a bad mood?

50
00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.420
I don't know.

51
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.580
If I knew why, I wouldn't
be this frustrated.

52
00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.690
Isn't it because of Dongha?

53
00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.810
I saw you two fighting yesterday.

54
00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:56.670
We didn't fight.

55
00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:58.630
I guess you're right.

56
00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.550
Fighting requires feelings.

57
00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.290
And you'd never have feelings for a human.

58
00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:07.620
Right?

59
00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.620
Lee Juwon.

60
00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.340
Let's go on a trip.

61
00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:16.470
What?

62
00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.820
Didn't you say you've
done everything you enjoy?

63
00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.680
That's why we should do
something you hate, like go on a trip.

64
00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:23.860
No way.

65
00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.990
I'm in a bad mood too.

66
00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.080
Come on.

67
00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.940
Think of it as a change of scenery.

68
00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.090
I said no.

69
00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:35.480
I'm begging you here.

70
00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.070
You're impossible.

71
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.430
Fine, I'll go.

72
00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:52.700
If we're going, let's go to the beach.

73
00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:54.710
Did you put on sunscreen?

74
00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:55.940
I bet you used a whole bottle.

75
00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.820
How did this suddenly turn into five of us?

76
00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.240
Otherwise, would it just be the two of us?

77
00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:02.530
So what?

78
00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.870
Can't we?

79
00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.560
Give it here.

80
00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:08.760
Thanks.

81
00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:09.810
You're welcome.

82
00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.160
Ugh...

83
00:06:26.161 --> 00:06:27.640
Who goes to the beach in the winter?

84
00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.790
This is perfect.

85
00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.226
I'm definitely sleeping in the
same room as Han Dongha tonight.

86
00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.550
You booked the rooms, right?

87
00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:34.710
Of course.

88
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.500
Finally...

89
00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:38.370
The day has finally come.

90
00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:42.530
Gyumin.

91
00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.620
I'm sorry about the other day.

92
00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.580
Hey.

93
00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:53.010
Don't get all mushy on me.

94
00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:54.850
Just get in the car.

95
00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.470
What do you...

96
00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:00.760
like to do?

97
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.500
No, I mean...

98
00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.890
I want to do things you enjoy... with you.

99
00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.210
Then...

100
00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.210
Let's find some things to do together.

101
00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:17.740
Feeling any better?

102
00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.800
Just a bit.

103
00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.280
I went too far yesterday.

104
00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.630
I'm sorry.

105
00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.170
This is my first time.

106
00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:40.980
First time what?

107
00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:42.520
Coming to the beach.

108
00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:43.690
Funny, right?

109
00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.050
It's my first time too.

110
00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.410
Really?

111
00:09:46.411 --> 00:09:47.470
No way.

112
00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.150
Why do you say that?

113
00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:51.230
I just always thought...

114
00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.680
unlike me, you've
experienced everything.

115
00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:55.930
Then from now on...

116
00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.070
let's experience everything together.

117
00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.670
What the heck?

118
00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.590
There's only one room?

119
00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:17.590
That's weird.

120
00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.350
I'm sure I booked three rooms.

121
00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.250
You did this on purpose, didn't you?

122
00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:23.410
Why would you do that?

123
00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.480
Huh?

124
00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:27.310
- No, that's not what happened!
- Well, the best part of a trip is...

125
00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:29.790
everyone sleeping in
the same room together.

126
00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:37.740
Looks like...

127
00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.169
we won't be having
any meat tonight, right?

128
00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.170
Right?

129
00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:45.000
How about we just fast today?

130
00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.720
Cleanse our systems.

131
00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:49.250
But I... I want to eat meat...

132
00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:55.980
True... We still have
to eat, no matter what.

133
00:10:58.430 --> 00:10:59.630
How does this thing work?

134
00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.320
Why isn't it lighting?

135
00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.000
Wow... Dongha, you're amazing!

136
00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.530
I'm fine.

137
00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:25.720
Just keep it on.

138
00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.290
It's already been a month.

139
00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.460
Yeah.

140
00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.950
When I first moved into this house,

141
00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.576
I never imagined it would be like this.

142
00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.800
Like what?

143
00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:54.910
I'm so happy I got to meet all of you.

144
00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.150
I don't think I'll ever forget this.

145
00:11:58.370 --> 00:11:59.370
Ever.

146
00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.140
And...

147
00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.160
I like Juwon.

148
00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:14.260
I'm challenging you.

149
00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.100
But you're too cool...

150
00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.260
I don't know if I'm any match for you.

151
00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.580
Why are you telling me this?

152
00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:34.790
I just...

153
00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.410
felt like I should tell you.

154
00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.260
Where are you going?

155
00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.000
I can't find Han Dongha.

156
00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.100
He'll come back on his own.

157
00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:14.080
He's not a kid.

158
00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.550
It's so dark out here.

159
00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.180
What if something happens to him?

160
00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:19.990
You go ahead and sleep.

161
00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.360
Don't go.

162
00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.860
What's wrong with you?

163
00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.040
I told you.

164
00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.840
It can't work between humans and our kind.

165
00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.150
Let me ask you something.

166
00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.600
Are you worried about
him as a friend, or...?

167
00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.740
I like you too.

168
00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.620
As a friend.

169
00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.150
But it's never crossed that line.

170
00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.420
You know that very well, don't you?

171
00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.250
I can sense that Juwon
has put up a strange wall.

172
00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.900
But I want to know what's hidden behind it.

173
00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.280
You might not be able to handle it.

174
00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.970
What are you doing out here?

175
00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.570
Want a sweet potato?

176
00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.200
You can still eat?

177
00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.140
There are marshmallows too.

178
00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.120
Juwon.

179
00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.130
But...

180
00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.100
I have a question for you.

181
00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:01.120
And you have to answer me honestly.

182
00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.540
What is it?

183
00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.470
You...

184
00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:08.210
You came to the beach because of me, right?

185
00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.240
You're getting a little full of yourself.

186
00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.080
You should be more honest with yourself.

187
00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:18.820
I try to do that every time.

188
00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:23.850
Even though it always feels
like I'm the one who loses.

189
00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.750
But I don't care.

190
00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.930
Because I'm not good at hiding things...

191
00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.540
What are you smiling at?

192
00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.190
Didn't you tell me to be honest?

193
00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:27.260
"My Secret Vampire"

